<div class="bg-transparent sm:w-4/5 md:w-3/5 my-12 md:mb-24">
  <h1>Welcome to the RIPE NCC</h1>
  <p class="text-base pb-0">As the Regional Internet Registry for Europe, Middle East and Central Asia, we serve over 20,000 members in 76 countries. We register IP addresses and ASNs, and act as the secretariat to the RIPE community.</p>
  
    
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-6">
  
    
