        <p class="text-neutral-soft pb-0 line-clamp-3">The RIPE NCC Strategy 2027-31 is now available. This strategy builds upon our existing vision, mission and values and sets the long-term direction for the organisation. The document explains RIPE NCC’s role in the Internet ecosystem, sets out six strategic focus areas for the coming five-year period and the external factors that influence our operating environment.</p>
        <dl class="pt-2 flex gap-x-[10px]">
