        <p class="text-neutral-soft pb-0 line-clamp-3">The RIPE NCC is looking for a host for RIPE 95 that will take place in Madrid at the Meliá Castilla Hotel from 15-19 November 2027.</p>
        <dl class="pt-2 flex gap-x-[10px]">
